config BR2_PACKAGE_OPENBAO
	bool "openbao"
	help
	  OpenBao, the node secrets store (ADR-0010, geekdojo/geekdojo-brain
	  #798). This package installs only the pinned upstream release
	  binary as /usr/bin/bao, its MPL-2.0 LICENSE and source notice under
	  /usr/share/licenses/openbao/, and the static openbao service user
	  (uid/gid 990). No unit and no config: nothing starts the binary
	  until the store's unit lands.

	  A pre-built CGO-free release binary, hash-pinned from upstream's
	  GPG- and cosign-verified checksums.txt. See
	  package/openbao/openbao.mk.

	  There is deliberately no architecture "depends on": a target
	  architecture the tarball map in openbao.mk does not know fails the
	  build instead of silently dropping the store from the image.

	  https://openbao.org
